1. Marine deposits, . . . (a) raised from the sea, or (b) yet in progress;
2. Detrital deposits, including (a) Erratic block group; (b) Ossiferous group; (c) Ossiferous caves and breccia;
3. Fluviatile and Lacustrine deposits, terminated, or yet in progress;—and in each case endeavour to bring forward the history of the phenomena to the present date.
